COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."whatsapp_instances"."daily_blast_cap" IS 'Per-number daily ceiling (Number Daily Cap, ADR-0015): max Leads this number may be used to blast per calendar day (America/Sao_Paulo). Server-enforced via blast_instance_daily_usage. Default 80 (CAP_RECOMMENDED). Distinct from org-wide organizations.daily_blast_budget.';



